CONTEXT Sales INCLUDES Stock
CONTEXT Sales, Stock INCLUDES Catalogue

CONTEXT Sales IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Sales
{+ One file holds three contexts and the inclusions between them.
The first context in the file is the one that is compiled.
The word FROM is not needed, because the included contexts are in the same file. +}
RELATION sold[Order*Catalogue.Product]
POPULATION sold[Order*Catalogue.Product] CONTAINS [ ("o1", "chair") ]
RULE inStock : sold |- sold;Stock.amount;Stock.amount~
ROLE Clerk MAINTAINS inStock
ENDCONTEXT

CONTEXT Stock IN ENGLISH
RELATION amount[Catalogue.Product*Amount] [UNI]
POPULATION amount[Catalogue.Product*Amount] CONTAINS [ ("chair", "12") ]
ENDCONTEXT

CONTEXT Catalogue IN ENGLISH
RELATION price[Product*Price] [UNI]
POPULATION price[Product*Price] CONTAINS [ ("chair", "45") ; ("table", "120") ]
ENDCONTEXT

CONTEXT Sales IN ENGLISH
-- A second fragment of the context Sales, in the same file. Fragments with the same name are united.
RELATION customer[Order*Customer] [UNI]
POPULATION customer[Order*Customer] CONTAINS [ ("o1", "Ada") ]
ENDCONTEXT
